@startuml
[*] --> Initial_State
Initial_State : Start of System

Initial_State --> Add_Item : Add Item
Initial_State --> Manage_Items : Manage Items

Add_Item : Add new item to wardrobe
Add_Item --> Initial_State : Return to Start
Add_Item --> Manage_Items : Proceed to Manage

Manage_Items : Manage existing items
Manage_Items --> View_Items : View Items
Manage_Items --> Organize_Items : Organize Items
Manage_Items --> Remove_Item : Remove Item

View_Items : View item details
View_Items --> Organize_Items : Organize Items
View_Items --> Remove_Item : Remove Item
View_Items --> Initial_State : Return to Start

Organize_Items : Organize items by type/size/color
Organize_Items --> Manage_Items : Continue Managing
Organize_Items --> Initial_State : Return to Start

Remove_Item : Remove item from wardrobe
Remove_Item --> Manage_Items : Continue Managing
Remove_Item --> Initial_State : Return to Start

Manage_Items --> [*] : Exit System
@enduml
